			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Standardize icon placement and spacing in README\n\nAdjust the positioning of landscape and mountain emojis in the README.md header and section titles. Move emojis to follow the text content and insert a hair space (`&#x2001;`) to prevent tight binding with surrounding characters. Remove emojis from the image badge line to maintain a clean, text-first layout.\n\nThis ensures consistent visual hierarchy and alignment with the project's typography standards for documentation.",
			"SHA": "8b721967be0b33d0378b2966e258683e4155dc79"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-13T22:04:57Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				76,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Standardize technical term formatting in security section\n\nApply Markdown backticks to `WASM` and `WASMtime` within the security features list of the README.md to align with project documentation standards. This ensures visual distinction for technical terminology consistent with previous updates to the file.\n\nThis change maintains style consistency across all technical references in the Grove documentation.",
			"SHA": "529929b7ea4bf01a17d06dd902908ce434b671c2"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-13T21:53:54Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				76,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Format technical terms in backticks for consistency\n\nApply Markdown backticks to technical terms throughout the README.md to ensure visual distinction and consistency with project documentation standards. Update references for `Rust`, `WASM`, `VS Code`, `Node.js`, `WASMtime`, `gRPC`, `IPC`, and related API surface terms.\n\nThis formatting change improves readability and aligns the Grove documentation style with the rest of the CodeEditorLand ecosystem, ensuring that all technical terminology is clearly demarcated.",
			"SHA": "0d71bba63165e8027edfab4e8eb315c4a976fc5f"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-13T21:12:46Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				76,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Correct license badge and reference URLs\n\nUpdate the `README.md` to point to the correct repository context for the LICENSE file. The previous links incorrectly referenced the `Land` root repository, whereas Grove is a distinct submodule.\n\nChange both the badge link and the inline license text reference to use `CodeEditorLand/Grove` instead of `CodeEditorLand/Land`. This ensures users are directed to the correct license file hosted within the Grove project directory.",
			"SHA": "51f0b01b606986bf46512010aeac3ad6d7fc6973"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-11T22:32:07Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				76,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Grove): Update WASM and telemetry dependency versions\n\nBump wasmparser from 0.247 to 0.248, opentelemetry-otlp from 0.31 to 0.32, and opentelemetry-semantic-conventions from 0.31 to 0.32 in Cargo.toml.\n\nThese patch updates align the Grove extension host with the latest stable releases, improving WASM parsing compatibility and telemetry export reliability.",
			"SHA": "0a69b1c44563ce9a8dcce90f0922e4be785077b1"
		}
